"""
Monitor Arranger — visual display arrangement for Hyprland/Omarchy.

Drag the screens around the canvas (magnetic snapping to edges and centres,
hold Shift to disable it), pick resolution, scale, rotation, VRR and
mirroring, then:
  - "Try"  -> applies it right away via `hyprctl eval`; unless you confirm
              within 15 s it rolls back to the previous configuration
  - "Save" -> updates ~/.config/hypr/monitors.lua (with a backup), keeping
              comments and unmanaged fields, and checks `hyprctl configerrors`

Usage:
    monitor-arranger                 # real monitors via hyprctl
    monitor-arranger --mock          # fake data, to try out the UI
    monitor-arranger --config FILE   # alternative monitors.lua file
"""

